<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset your Anon password</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 33%);
        background-color: hsl(0, 0%, 93%);
      }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      .wrapper {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: hsl(0, 100%, 100%);
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 90%);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 13%);
        padding: 28px 36px;
      }
      .header-logo {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: hsl(0, 100%, 100%);
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      .header-logo span { color: hsl(353, 100%, 78%); }
      .body { padding: 36px; }
      .icon {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 97%);
        border: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 90%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 13%);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .intro {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 47%);
        margin-bottom: 32px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .otp-label {
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 47%);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .otp-box {
        display: inline-block;
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 97%);
        border: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 90%);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px 36px;
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 8px;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 13%);
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }
      .expires {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: hsl(353, 100%, 78%);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 97%);
        border: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 90%);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 47%);
      }
      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 93%);
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .note { font-size: 13px; color: hsl(0, 0%, 47%); }
      .footer {
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 97%);
        border-top: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 93%);
        padding: 20px 36px;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: hsl(0, 0%, 60%);
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .footer a { color: hsl(353, 100%, 78%); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="header-logo">Anon<span>.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <div class="icon">🔒</div>
        <p class="greeting">Password reset request</p>
        <p class="intro">
          Hi <%= name %>, we received a request to reset the password for your Anon account.
          Use the code below to verify it's really you. This code expires in <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="otp-label">Your reset code</p>
        <div class="otp-box"><%= otp %></div>

        <p class="expires">⏳ Expires in 5 minutes</p>

        <div class="warning-box">
          🔐 Never share this code with anyone. Anon staff will never ask you for it.
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <p class="note">
          If you didn't request a password reset, you can ignore this email.
          Your password will remain unchanged.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Anon Marketplace. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 4px;">
          Need help? <a href="mailto:support@anon.lk">support@anon.lk</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
